%%{init: {'theme':'dark'}}%%
%% Data flow - Start-up
%% Corrected 2026-08-23:
%%  - removed "store endpoint mappings" (tool_endpoints was dead code)
%%  - clarified that the session is the agent's conversation session,
%%    not an MCP session (2026-07-28 has no protocol sessions)
%%  - added the required headers and _meta on tools/list
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Docker
    participant M as MCP Server
    participant A as Agent Service
    participant W as Web Service

    D->>M: Start container (depends_on: none)
    Note over M: Initialise FastAPI<br/>Load API keys
    M-->>D: Health: ready

    D->>A: Start container (depends_on: mcp-server)
    Note over A: Initialise FastAPI<br/>Create LLM client<br/>Initialise SQLite DB

    A->>M: POST /message - tools/list<br/>MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28<br/>Mcp-Method: tools/list<br/>params._meta: protocolVersion + clientCapabilities
    M-->>A: Tools manifest<br/>resultType, ttlMs, cacheScope
    Note over A: Convert MCP tools to<br/>OpenAI function calling format

    Note over A: Create conversation session (SQLite)<br/>NB: application level, not MCP
    A-->>D: Health: ready

    D->>W: Start container (depends_on: travel-agent)
    Note over W: Initialise FastAPI<br/>Load templates
    W->>A: GET /health
    A-->>W: Status: healthy
    W-->>D: Health: ready

    Note over D,W: All services ready - system operational
